        "There was a misunderstanding: the host",
        "family had not received our message."
      ],
      "audioText": "There was a misunderstanding: the host family had not received our message.",
      "audioMode": "tts",
      "languageCode": "en",
      "patternId": "n4-b1-consolidation-capstone-5"
    },
    {
      "id": "en.n4.class-100.t02",
      "en": "The cause must have been the wrong address, because the message came back.",
      "es": "La causa debió de ser la dirección equivocada, porque el mensaje volvió.",
      "explanationEs": "Must have + participio: deducción respaldada por una prueba.",
      "segments": [
        "The cause must have been the wrong",
        "address, because the message came back."
      ],
      "audioText": "The cause must have been the wrong address, because the message came back.",
